<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Dimension Data year shr rises 58 percent.</title>
<headline>Dimension Data year shr rises 58 percent.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     20.5	  vs 13.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   84.21	 vs 50.97</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   141.13	vs 90.83</p>
<p>    Tax			 46.69	 vs 31.07</p>
<p>    Net tax		   94.44	 vs 59.76</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,019.03	 vs 719.81</p>
<p>Full name: Dimesnion Data Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - South African communications networks to software firm Dimension Data said a number of new intiatives are expected to materialise in 1997 which will complement current activities and earnings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
